  "description": "Circuit-level design of passive LC and RC filter networks that smooth rectifier ripple into near-DC and shape signal frequency response. Covers capacitor-input, LC, pi-section, and CLC filters for power supply ripple reduction, plus low-pass, high-pass, band-pass, and band-stop signal filters. Owns the circuit-design pedagogy; active/op-amp filters are deferred to op-amp-circuits.",
